const contempCfg = {
  steps: [
    { math: '1 · The laboratory moved home', note: 'Anthropology once studied "elsewhere"; now it studies everywhere — labs (Traweek on particle physics), finance (Ho on Wall Street), algorithms, aid organisations, megachurches. Every institution is a culture with a fieldwork inside it.' },
    { math: '2 · Studying up', note: 'Nader\'s call (1969): study the powerful, not only the governed. Corporate boardrooms, regulatory agencies and standards bodies have worldviews, rituals and blind spots — ethnography makes them visible.' },
    { math: '3 · Ethnography of technology', note: 'How algorithms get made (Seaver on recommender systems), how data centres organise work, how developers believe — the systems of the AI ladder studied anthropologically: culture all the way down.' },
